  "releaseNotes": "📦 Release Notes – RS.Dapper.Utility v1.0.4\n\nFixes:\n\nResolved an issue with PostgreSQL where queries failed due to uppercase column names.\n\nImproved query generation to ensure proper handling of case-sensitive identifiers in PostgreSQL.\n\nNotes:\n\nThis update enhances compatibility and reliability when working with PostgreSQL databases.",
